      "message": "I\u0027m probably missing something. Isn\u0027t implementing Typeface in JetSki adding another step in a linear pipeline.\nThe way I understand it:\nRight now, the experience would be to make a Font obj using a String, then pass that into Text. (bad practice, but temporary)\nThe API when fixed later would be to make a Typeface obj using a String, then pass that into the Font constructor, then pass that into Text.",
